``real_space_grid_search``: new option ``characteristic_grid=None`` sets the angular step of the search grid for each target cell length from the spot resolution, so that long cell axes are not missed. It is slower than the default fixed 0.02 rad grid, increasingly so for long cells and many spots, and applies wherever ``real_space_grid_search`` is used (``dials.index``, ``dials.ssx_index``, ``dials.stills_process``).
